Note: Todo App — SQLite-backed task tracker with a web UI + JSON API
Note: Run with: epl run examples/todo_app/main.epl
Note: Then open http://localhost:8000
Note:
Note: All write queries use parameterized SQL (the "?" placeholders) so user
Note: input can never be interpreted as SQL — the injection-safe pattern.

Display "Initializing todo database..."
db = db_open("todo_app.db")
db_execute(db, "CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS todos (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT, task TEXT NOT NULL, done INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0)")

Note: Seed a couple of rows the first time the app runs.
existing = db_query_one(db, "SELECT count(*) as count FROM todos")
If existing.count == 0 Then
    db_execute(db, "INSERT INTO todos (task, done) VALUES (?, ?)", ["Learn EPL syntax", 1])
    db_execute(db, "INSERT INTO todos (task, done) VALUES (?, ?)", ["Build a todo app", 0])
End

Create webapp app

Note: ── Home page ──
Route "/" shows
    Page "EPL Todo Tracker"
        Heading "EPL Todo Tracker ✅"
        Text "A SQLite-backed task tracker written in plain English."
        Link "View todos as JSON" to "/api/todos"
    End
End

Note: ── List all todos ──
Route "/api/todos" responds with
    Send json db_query(db, "SELECT id, task, done FROM todos ORDER BY id")
End

Note: ── Create a todo  (POST body: {"task": "..."}) ──
Route "/api/add" responds with
    data = web_request_data()
    task = trim(data["task"])
    If length(task) > 0 Then
        db_execute(db, "INSERT INTO todos (task, done) VALUES (?, 0)", [task])
        Send json Map with ok = True and message = "Added"
    Otherwise
        Send json Map with ok = False and error = "Task text is required"
    End
End

Note: ── Toggle a todo's done flag ──
Route "/api/toggle/{id}" responds with
    db_execute(db, "UPDATE todos SET done = CASE WHEN done = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END WHERE id = ?", [to_integer(id)])
    Send json Map with ok = True
End

Note: ── Delete a todo ──
Route "/api/delete/{id}" responds with
    db_execute(db, "DELETE FROM todos WHERE id = ?", [to_integer(id)])
    Send json Map with ok = True
End

Display "Todo app running at http://localhost:8000"
Start app on port 8000
